  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PROTECTING THE RHINO POPULATIONS IN TWO OF KWAZULU-NATAL&apos;S FLAGSHIP INTENSIVE PROTECTION ZONE PARKS, SOUTH AFRICA BY SUPPORTING RANGERS WELFARE AND ABILITY TO DEPLOY INTO THE FIELD</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TO CONSERVE AND SUSTAINABLY MANAGE A FREE-RANGING META-POPULATION OF BLACK RHINOCEROS COMPRISING OF AT LEAST 740 INDIVIDUALS THROUGHOUT ITS HISTORICAL RANGE IN KZN, SUPPORTED THROUGH A SHARED COMMITMENT ON PRIVATE, COMMUNITY, AND STATE LAND.</narrative>
  </description>
